      "renderer": "three.js r170, WebGL, low-power, pixel ratio max 2, ACES filmic tone mapping, sRGB output; lazy-loaded, optional",
      "board": "split-flap grid, 2 rows x 18 cols (desktop) or 4 x 12 (canvas < 560px); tile .26 x .38 world units, gaps .028 x .05",
