      "tile": "fixed top half + fixed bottom half + hinged flap (front = current top, back = next bottom, pre-rotated); MeshStandardMaterial roughness .55",
      "glyphs": "one canvas atlas per audience colour, 8 columns, 128 x 187px cells; cell #1c1c1e, glyph Archivo 700 semi-expanded at 62% of cell height, split line #0b0b0c 4px at mid-height",
